   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Closeup of a board room meeting at a business company, usual scene at any modern company. There are four men and three women, one of the women is sitting in foreground sideways to the camera and using a digital tablet.</rdf:li>
